### === ЛР №3: Аутентификация и авторизация ===

### 15. Регистрация (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.ru",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### 16. Регистрация дубликата (409)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.ru",
  "password": "Another123!"
}

### 17. Регистрация без полей (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 18. Вход (200, возвращает token)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.ru",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### 19. Вход с неверным паролем (401, remainingAttempts)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.ru",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### 20. 5 неудачных попыток -> блокировка (423, повторить 5 раз)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.ru",
  "password": "wrong"
}

